    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "581f547c-7345-4f9d-abfa-4c85249c89a8",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome dinner\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide in France\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EReturn Channel ferry crossings\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "2b96ec34-baeb-43c8-8717-1096f536bc18",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFive nights at the 3* Best Western Hotel Adagio in Saumur. Situated on a delightful island on the Loire, facilities include a bar and all rooms are en suite. Dinner is included the first night and the remaining nights are on bed and breakfast basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "c535046e-e821-4d83-aad2-7bc25ab5f1b8",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESaumur\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETours - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00E2teau de Saumur\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGratien \u0026amp; Meyer wine cellars\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00E2teau d\u2019Amboise\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00E2teau de Chenonceau\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAbbaye de Fontevraud\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00E2teau de Villandry\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAngers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00E2teau d\u2019Angers - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMus\u00E9e des Beaux Arts d\u0026#39;Angers - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMonet\u2019s Garden at Giverny\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "253fe671-d9c5-4946-b5fa-516e543a00c3",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00E2teau Brissac - acquired in 1502 by Ren\u00E9 de Coss\u00E9, first Lord of Brissac, and still the residence of the 13th Duke of Brissac, offers walks under imposing century old trees, along the riverbanks of the Aubance\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00E2teau d\u2019Azay-le-Rideau - one of the earliest of the Italianate style Renaissance ch\u00E2teaux of the Loire\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELa Cave aux Sculptures - Protestant stonemasons in the 16th century Wars of Religion carved more than 400 figures into the walls, floors and ceilings\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00E2teau du Plessis-Bourre - unaltered since 1468, the ch\u00E2teau was built by Jean Bourre, a friend and treasurer to Louis XI and Charles VIII\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "c98d547e-6654-4e12-8e34-e9472e8cdd53",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Saumur\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your designated pick up points \u2013 take the cross Channel ferry from your preferred port \u2013 continue to the 3* Best Western Hotel Adagio in Saumur \u2013 dinner in the hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Tours, Ch\u00E2teau de Saumur \u0026amp; wine tasting\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of the medieval quarter of Tours, a showcase of Gothic architecture including the stunning Cathedral St-Gatien \u2013 continue to Ch\u00E2teau de Saumur, built during the 14th century for the Ducs d\u2019Anjou \u2013 tour and tasting at the nearby Gratien \u0026amp; Meyer Wine Cellars.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Ch\u00E2teaux d\u2019Amboise \u0026amp; de Chenonceau\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe impressive Renaissance Ch\u00E2teau d\u2019Amboise houses the Chapel St Hubert, resting place of Leonardo da Vinci, and the Clos Luce where Da Vinci spent the last four years of his life \u2013 Ch\u00E2teau de Chenonceau is perhaps the most elegant of all ch\u00E2teaux in the Loire Valley and renowned for the arches that carry it across the water.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Abbaye de Fontevraud \u0026amp; Ch\u00E2teau de Villandry\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAbbaye de Fontevraud is the 12th century resting place of Henry II, Eleanor of Aquitaine and Richard the Lion Heart \u2013 visit Ch\u00E2teau de Villandry with its famous 16th century three tiered gardens comprising a pond, and decorative and kitchen gardens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Angers, Ch\u00E2teau d\u2019Angers \u0026amp; Mus\u00E9e des Beaux Arts\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVisit Angers, the capital from which Plantagenet kings ruled England and half of France \u2013 guided tour of Ch\u00E2teau d\u2019Angers, dating back to 1230 and home to the largest known medieval tapestry, the Apocalypse Tapestry \u2013 guided tour of the Mus\u00E9e des Beaux Arts d\u2019Angers, housed inside the beautiful late 15th century Logis Barrault, the house of the King\u0026#39;s Treasurer Olivier Barrault.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Monet\u2019s Garden\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDepending on the location of your preferred port, visit Monet\u2019s Garden at Giverny where Monet came repeatedly through his life, letting his imagination rove amid the complex interplay of light and water to paint his magnificent Waterlillies series \u2013 continue for our Channel crossing back to the UK and then return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
